  <LoadingProgress.ClearEstimatesOnModListChange>TODO</LoadingProgress.ClearEstimatesOnModListChange>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, the stored load time history is cleared whenever the mod list changes. This ensures that the estimate always reflects your current mod setup.\n\nDisable this if you want the estimate to persist across mod list changes, for example if you frequently add or remove mods and still want a rough baseline. -->
  <LoadingProgress.ClearEstimatesOnModListChange.Tip>TODO</LoadingProgress.ClearEstimatesOnModListChange.Tip>
  <!-- EN: Show loading time as countdown -->
  <LoadingProgress.LoadingTimeAsCountDown>Mostrar tiempo de carga como cuenta regresiva</LoadingProgress.LoadingTimeAsCountDown>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, the mod will display the loading time as a countdown, starting from the estimated loading time. This is useful to see how much time is left until the game is fully loaded. -->
  <LoadingProgress.LoadingTimeAsCountDown.Tip>Cuando está activado, el mod mostrará el tiempo de carga como una cuenta regresiva, comenzando desde el tiempo de carga estimado. Esto es útil para ver cuánto tiempo queda hasta que el juego esté completamente cargado.</LoadingProgress.LoadingTimeAsCountDown.Tip>
